WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.223 --> 00:00:02.700
- I kind of weirdly want
people to pull over right now.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.623
I realize if you get letters 
or calls that people got

00:00:05.623 --> 00:00:07.004
into accidents,
that's on you guys.

00:00:07.004 --> 00:00:09.213
I'm waiving all my liability.
- Thank you, Gary.

00:00:09.213 --> 00:00:10.741
- I want you to pull over.

00:00:10.741 --> 00:00:12.993
I want you look at that mirror, 
rearview mirror, right,

00:00:12.993 --> 00:00:13.823
that's what it's called, right?
- [Woman] Yeah, yeah.

00:00:13.823 --> 00:00:14.543
- Thank you.

00:00:14.543 --> 00:00:16.193
I want you to look at it, you
need to understand if you

00:00:16.193 --> 00:00:19.914
look at it, it's your fault.
- [Elvis] What do you mean?

00:00:19.914 --> 00:00:22.534
- Everything in life is on you.
- [Elvis] Right.

00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:25.614
- It's not your dad's
fault who was a drinker.

00:00:25.614 --> 00:00:29.194
It's not your boyfriend
that, you know, cheated on you.

00:00:29.194 --> 00:00:32.114
It's not your girlfriend
who's always putting you down.

00:00:32.114 --> 00:00:34.234
It is your fundamental fault.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:36.434
The second you 
make that decision

00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:38.524
then you can go on the offense.

00:00:38.524 --> 00:00:41.091
